  <rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.label>高潮分裂不稳定</rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.label>
  <rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.description>拥有此基因的异种体会在高潮后逐渐变得不稳定。当不稳定性达到临界值时，将自动启动有丝分裂。</rjw_genes_orgasmic_mytosis_hediff.description>
